SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
---------------------

The MIT Licence below covers the work of team La Espada in this repository: everything under solution/
(code, the trained model files in solution/models/ and the aggregate reports in solution/reports/), README.md
and docs/report/ (the technical document). The organisers' files are covered by the LICENSE at the repository root.

It does NOT cover the match data of the challenge or any external dataset. The model files were trained on
Sportec Open DFL data (CC-BY 4.0; Bassek et al., Scientific Data 2025) and Metrica Sports' public sample data;
credit those sources when you reuse the models.

